000100*================================================================*
000200* PROGRAM    : CMB050                                            *
000300* TITLE      : GDG ROLL-OFF AND TAPE RETENTION CHECK             *
000400* SYSTEM     : MERIDIAN EOD - COMMON SERVICES (CM)               *
000500*----------------------------------------------------------------*
000600* DESCRIPTION:                                                   *
000700*   READS THE WEEKLY GDG STATUS EXTRACT (ONE CARD PER GDG BASE,  *
000800*   BUILT FROM LISTCAT BY THE STORAGE GROUP) AND THE TAPE        *
000900*   LIBRARY EXTRACT, AND PRINTS AN EXCEPTION REPORT FOR OPS:     *
001000*     - GDG AT OR WITHIN ONE GENERATION OF ITS LIMIT (THE NEXT   *
001100*       CATALOG WILL ROLL OFF THE OLDEST GENERATION)             *
001200*     - TAPE GENERATION OLDER THAN THE RETENTION PERIOD          *
001300*       (ELIGIBLE FOR SCRATCH - VAULT TO RECALL)                 *
001400*     - TAPE VOLUME ON THE GDG EXTRACT BUT NOT IN THE TAPE       *
001500*       LIBRARY (MISSING / NOT RETURNED FROM OFFSITE)            *
001600*   RETENTION PERIOD FROM SYSIN CARD 'RETPD=NNNN' (DAYS),        *
001700*   DEFAULT 35.                                                  *
001800*                                                                *
001900* FILES:                                                         *
002000*   DATECARD  INPUT   MSEC.PROD.CM.DATECARD(0)      FB  80       *
002100*   GDGLIST   INPUT   MSEC.PROD.CM.GDGSTAT.WEEKLY   FB  80       *
002200*   TAPELIB   INPUT   MSEC.PROD.CM.TAPELIB.EXTRACT  FB  80       *
002300*                     (SORTED BY VOLSER)                         *
002400*   SYSIN     INPUT   RETENTION CARD                FB  80       *
002500*   EXCPTRPT  OUTPUT  CMR050 EXCEPTION REPORT       FBA 133      *
002600* CALLS      : CMU010 CMU050 CMU060                              *
002700* RETURN CODE: 0 NO EXCEPTIONS, 4 EXCEPTIONS PRINTED             *
002800*----------------------------------------------------------------*
002900* CHANGE HISTORY                                                 *
003000* DATE       BY   TICKET    DESCRIPTION                          *
003100* ---------- ---  --------  ------------------------------------ *
003200* 1992-08-10 DWB            ORIGINAL - REQUESTED BY TAPE LIBRARY *
003300*                           AFTER LOSS OF TRADE HISTORY GDG      *
003400* 1993-02-01 DWB  CHG00455  MISSING VOLUME CHECK                 *
003500* 1995-11-20 DWB  CHG01811  RETENTION FROM SYSIN (WAS 30 FIXED)  *
003600* 1999-03-15 TLM  CHG04471  Y2K - CREATION DATE CCYYDDD ON BOTH  *
003700*                           EXTRACTS                             *
