031000*----------------------------------------------------------------*
031100* ONE GDG BASE                                                   *
031200*----------------------------------------------------------------*
031300 3000-CHECK-GDG.
031400     READ GDG-LIST-FILE
031500         AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-GDG-EOF-SW
031600                GO TO 3000-EXIT.
031700     ADD 1 TO WS-GDG-READ.
031800     IF GL-BASE-NAME = SPACES OR GL-BASE-NAME(1:1) = '*'
